                "loc": "DEU.27.2+DEU.27.3+DEU.27.4+DEU.27.5+DEU.27.6+DEU.27.7+DEU.27.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 27.2-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio Yoshua ombakhila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli, alutare khu sikulu sia Ebali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 20.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Akhola khuloondekhana ne kamalaka niko Musa, omukholi owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, aelesia Baisiraeli. Lilaka lia Musa liaandikwa lili: “Alutare elikholwa khukhwama khu mabaale niko bakhabeechakho ne embasa eye sichuuma tawe.” Baanila khu alutare ng'eneyo biianwa bie khukhwosia khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, lundi barusirakho biianwa biabwe bie kumuleembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwenao, mumoni che Baisiraeli, Yoshua aandika khu mabaale kamalaka niko Musa aandika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.11.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 11.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.11+DEU.27.12+DEU.27.13+DEU.27.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27.11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baisiraeli boosi: bakasa, ne babemeelesi babwe, banamae, bakhalaki, basaalwa, alala ne baakwa ba babamenyamo, bema chimbeka chombi che Lisanduku lie ndakaano eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Boosi baloleelela basaayi ba baaba Balawi, babaasuta lisaanduku lie ndakaano eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Enusu eye babaandu bema ne bapile kimikoongo kiabwe ebweeni we sikulu sia Kerisimu ne babaandi bema ne bapile kimikoongo kiabwe ebweeni we sikulu sia Ebali. Musa, omukholi owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aba ababoolela khukhola bario siise ne siola khu nibo khubiitwa chikhabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa kano, Yoshua asoma kamalaka koosi, alala ne chikhabi ne bilaamo, nga ne biaandikwa mu sitabu sie lilaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua asoma kamalaka koosi niko Musa aamulaka. Libuusiana lie Baisiraeli boosi: be siseecha, nende be siikhasi, babaana ne bakwa boosi baulila kamakhuwa ka Yoshua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
